      <td class="govuk-table__cell">Centralised SIEM, immutable logging, FOI-defensible record</td>
    </tr>
    <tr class="govuk-table__row">
      <th scope="row" class="govuk-table__header">Bedrock cost controls</th>
      <td class="govuk-table__cell">Per-document classification</td>
      <td class="govuk-table__cell">Budget alerts, model usage caps, on-prem fallback for sensitive content</td>
    </tr>
    <tr class="govuk-table__row">
      <th scope="row" class="govuk-table__header">Guardrails</th>
      <td class="govuk-table__cell">Default content / topic / PII set</td>
