    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<div class="govuk-inset-text govuk-!-margin-top-4">
  <p class="govuk-body">
    <strong>The point isn't that this scenario is production-ready out of the box.</strong> The point is that the heavy lifting — OCR, classification, RAG, Guardrails, multi-format conversion — is already done. The bits left are integration with your council's identity, network, retention rules and procurement framework.
  </p>
</div>

